      "definition": "Sports, cultural programs, reunions, family activities, and alumni events."
    },
    {
      "id": "university",
      "labelBn": "বিশ্ববিদ্যালয় ও ক্যাম্পাস সম্পৃক্ততা",
      "labelEn": "University & campus engagement",
      "definition": "Current students, university development, academic links, campus programs, and institutional collaboration."
    },
    {
      "id": "women",
